        "original_id": "880e96c0-dc77-50b8-b1fe-3010ed42a6aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: How Glory Goes\n- People: Audra McDonald, Harold Arlen, Adam Guettel, Elena Shaddow, Katie Clarke\n- Works: The Light in the Piazza\n- Roles: Clara Johnson\n- Topics: musical theater, opera\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Guettel was born on December 16, 1964.\n- Adam Guettel is an American composer-lyricist of musical theater and opera.\n- How Glory Goes is the second album by Audra McDonald, and it was released in 2000.\n- Five songs on How Glory Goes were written by Harold Arlen.\n- Two songs on How Glory Goes were written by Adam Guettel, including the title track.\n- Elena Shaddow toured as Clara Johnson in Adam Guettel's The Light in the Piazza before leaving the production.\n- Katie Clarke replaced Elena Shaddow in the role of Clara Johnson in Adam Guettel's The Light in the Piazza.",
